---
description: Compare feasible plot concepts against member preferences and explain whose goals each serves.
args: { garden: GardenDossier; preferences: GardenPreference[]; conditions: PlotConditionMap[] }
returns: PlotAlternative[]
---
For each feasible plan, identify participating members, desired uses served, access needs met, and any tradeoff imposed. A plan that assigns work without an explicit owner agreement is not feasible. Preserve minority preferences as unresolved rather than averaging them out.
